# Embargoed / not-yet-public writeups. Jekyll would skip _drafts anyway,
# but this repo is PUBLIC — ignoring the folder keeps unpublished PoCs
# out of the pushed source until each advisory goes public.
# To publish one: move it to _posts/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md and commit that.
_drafts/
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.sass-cache/
*.tmp
